"* **Comprehensive Translation Support**: The add-on is now fully localized with support for 17 global languages. \n"
"  *(Note: These translations were generated by AI, so some minor translation errors or inaccuracies may be present.)*\n"
"* **Strict Code Governance**: Applied GPL-2.0 copyright headers across the entire codebase."
